  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_3072362e-3736-4bf8-8803-000e12c980f4.png\"></p><p>這是<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/despawntweaker\" rel=\"nofollow\">DespawnTweaker</a>的多載入器移植版本，一個能修復生物不會被清除問題的性能優化模組。</p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1191080/description_636e41af-923f-4777-bf68-6bf3ddf16707.png\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/nRQKp3Thsz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/790272037578473512?label=Luna Pixel&amp;color=393939&amp;labelColor=0843bf&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/kS7auUeYmc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/901654795100749884?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white&amp;label=Txni&amp;labelColor=36633c&amp;color=393939\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/txnimc/DespawnTweaks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Github&amp;color=393939&amp;labelColor=666666&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Github&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"!<a href=\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/txni/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=CurseForge&amp;color=393939&amp;labelColor=fb594a&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=CurseForge&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"!<a href=\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fTxni\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Modrinth&amp;color=393939&amp;labelColor=33de61&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=Modrinth&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"!<a href=\"></a></strong></p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1191080/description_f24ea6b6-86b8-451f-9b9d-84772a66ba23.png\"></p><h3>功能特色：</h3><ul>\n<li>允許撿起物品或裝備的生物自然消失。</li>\n<li>生物消失時會正確掉落持有的戰利品。</li>\n<li>允許從生怪磚生成的生物繞過此規則，可選僅在特定結構中生效。</li>\n<li>提升專用伺服器與單人遊戲的性能表現。</li>\n</ul>",
